.TH SCROLL-REVAMPED 1 "2026-11-16" "scroll-revamped" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
scroll-revamped \- the mouse wheel to apps that scroll, copy-mode for the rest
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B scroll-revamped
.RI [ options ]
.B apply
.br
.B scroll-revamped
.RB [ \-\-json ]
.B list
.br
.B scroll-revamped check
.I alternate mouse history pane
.br
.B scroll-revamped doctor
.br
.B scroll-revamped version
.br
.B scroll-revamped help
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B scroll-revamped
routes the mouse wheel in tmux. A pane running an app that scrolls itself,
such as vim, less or htop, gets the wheel; any other pane enters copy-mode and
scrolls its history. It also tunes copy-mode scrolling, copies a mouse
selection to the system clipboard, and switches windows when the wheel rolls
over the status line. The entry point
.B scroll-revamped.tmux
runs
.B apply
once when tmux loads the plugin, and every binding goes to tmux in one call.
.PP
Run with no command on a terminal, it offers a menu.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B apply
Bind the wheel now.
.TP
.B list
Print every binding apply would make, one per line.
.TP
.BI check " alternate mouse history pane"
Decide one wheel tick on tmux before 2.0, where the wheel cannot be decided by
a format: exit 0 to pass the tick to the app, 1 to enter copy-mode. The last
decision is cached in
.B @scroll_revamped_cache_key
and
.BR @scroll_revamped_cache_val .
.TP
.B doctor
Print one row per dependency: tmux, the clipboard tool drag copy uses, gum and
the core tools. Exits 1 only when a required tool is missing.
.TP
.B version
Print the version, then the tmux version.
.TP
.B help
Print the help page.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-json
.B list
prints one JSON object.
.TP
.BI \-\-theme " name"
Colours of the terminal interface:
.BR kodougu ,
.BR catppuccin\-mocha ,
.BR catppuccin\-latte ,
.BR dracula ,
.BR nord ,
.BR gruvbox ,
.B tokyo\-night
or
.BR mono .
The default is
.BR kodougu .
.TP
.BI \-\- setting " value"
Any tmux option below, named with dashes, such as
.B \-\-wheel
or
.BR \-\-skip\-empty .
It also takes the form
.IR \-\-setting = value .
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SCROLL_REVAMPED_SETTING
Any tmux option below in capitals, such as
.BR SCROLL_REVAMPED_WHEEL .
The command line wins over the environment, and the environment over the
tmux option.
.TP
.B SCROLL_REVAMPED_THEME
The theme when
.B \-\-theme
is not given.
.TP
.B SCROLL_REVAMPED_ACCENT
A colour such as #CBA6F7 that replaces the accent of the theme.
.TP
.B KODOUGU_THEME
The theme of every kodougu and tmux-revamped tool, when neither
.B \-\-theme
nor
.B SCROLL_REVAMPED_THEME
is set.
.TP
.B KODOUGU_ACCENT
The accent of every kodougu and tmux-revamped tool, when
.B SCROLL_REVAMPED_ACCENT
is not set.
.TP
.B NO_COLOR
Turns colour off in every theme.
.SH TMUX OPTIONS
An empty tmux option means its default.
.TP
.B @scroll_revamped_wheel
.B on
binds the root-table WheelUpPane and WheelDownPane that route the wheel. The
default is
.BR off ,
which leaves tmux's own wheel bindings in place.
.TP
.B @scroll_revamped_passthrough_alternate
Pass the wheel to an app on the alternate screen. The default is
.BR on .
.TP
.B @scroll_revamped_passthrough_mouse
Pass the wheel to an app that asked for the mouse. The default is
.BR on .
.TP
.B @scroll_revamped_skip_empty
.B on
keeps the wheel out of copy-mode on a pane with no history. The default is
.BR off .
.TP
.B @scroll_revamped_select_pane
.B on
focuses the pane under the pointer before scrolling. The default is
.BR off .
.TP
.B @scroll_revamped_alt_keys
.B arrow
or
.B page
turns the wheel into arrow or page keys for an alternate-screen app with the
mouse off, such as less, man or vi. Arrow mode sends
.B @scroll_revamped_speed
keys per tick, 3 when it is unset, at most 20. Needs tmux 2.0.
.TP
.B @scroll_revamped_mouse
.B off
stops the plugin from setting tmux's
.B mouse
option. The default is
.BR on .
.TP
.B @scroll_revamped_speed
A positive whole number of lines one copy-mode tick scrolls.
.TP
.B @scroll_revamped_granularity
How far one copy-mode tick scrolls:
.BR line ,
.B halfpage
or
.BR page .
The default is
.BR line .
.TP
.B @scroll_revamped_auto_exit
.B on
leaves copy-mode when a downward tick is already at the bottom. The default is
.BR off .
.TP
.B @scroll_revamped_indicator
.B on
flashes the scroll position on each copy-mode tick, on tmux 3.2 and later. The
default is
.BR off .
.TP
.B @scroll_revamped_drag_copy
.B on
copies a mouse selection in copy-mode to the system clipboard through
pbcopy, wl-copy, xclip or xsel. The default is
.BR off .
.TP
.B @scroll_revamped_click_copy
.B on
copies the word under a double click and the line under a triple click to the
system clipboard through the same tool, and leaves copy-mode, on tmux 3.2 and
later. The default is
.BR off .
.TP
.B @scroll_revamped_smooth
.B on
scrolls a copy-mode tick in steps with a pause of 5 milliseconds between, one
line per step up to 20 lines, so the text slides instead of jumping, on tmux
3.2 and later. It applies to the line granularity and to a speed below 1000.
The default is
.BR off .
.TP
.B @scroll_revamped_status_wheel
.B on
switches windows when the wheel rolls over the status line, on tmux 2.1 and
later. The default is
.BR off .
.TP
.B @revamped_theme
The theme of every tmux-revamped tool, when nothing else sets one. The default
is
.BR kodougu .
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success, 1 on any failure;
.B check
exits 1 to mean copy-mode.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tmux (1),
.BR gum (1)
